{
  "name": "Usami - Daily Briefing (agendado)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7,
              "triggerAtMinute": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Disparo Diario (07:30)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=-23.5505&longitude=-46.6333&current=temperature_2m,weather_code,relative_humidity_2m&daily=temperature_2m_max,temperature_2m_min&timezone=America%2FSao_Paulo",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 5000
        }
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Consultar Clima (Open-Meteo)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const weatherData = $input.first().json;\nconst now = new Date();\nconst dateStr = now.toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n\nconst tempNow = weatherData.current?.temperature_2m ?? 'N/D';\nconst tempMax = weatherData.daily?.temperature_2m_max?.[0] ?? 'N/D';\nconst tempMin = weatherData.daily?.temperature_2m_min?.[0] ?? 'N/D';\nconst humidity = weatherData.current?.relative_humidity_2m ?? 'N/D';\n\nconst weatherSummary = `Temperatura atual: ${tempNow}°C (Mín: ${tempMin}°C / Máx: ${tempMax}°C) | Umidade: ${humidity}%`;\n\nconst filename = `briefing-${dateStr}.md`;\n\nconst markdown = `---\ntitle: Daily Briefing - ${dateStr}\nsource: usami-automation\nkind: daily-briefing\ncreated_at: ${now.toISOString()}\nweather: ${JSON.stringify(weatherSummary)}\n---\n\n# ☀️ Briefing Matinal da Usami — ${dateStr}\n\n### 🌡️ Clima e Ambiente\n- ${weatherSummary}\n\n### 📋 Foco do Dia\n- [ ] Revisar projetos ativos e pendências prioritárias\n- [ ] Sessão de foco com a Usami\n- [ ] Organizar tarefas do dia\n\n### 💬 Mensagem da Usami\n> \"Bom dia! Preparei o seu dia no Obsidian. Não esquece de se hidratar e focar no que importa hoje, tá bom? Estou por aqui se precisar de mim!\"\n`;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    dateStr,\n    filename,\n    markdown,\n    weatherSummary,\n    proactiveSay: `Bom dia! Seu briefing de ${dateStr} já está pronto no Obsidian com a previsão do tempo. Vamos com tudo hoje!`\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Gerar Nota de Briefing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        640,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toText",
        "sourceProperty": "markdown",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {
          "encoding": "utf8",
          "fileName": "={{ $json.filename }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Converter para Arquivo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        860,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "write",
        "fileName": "={{ '/files/obsidian/usami/Inbox/Automations/' + $('Gerar Nota de Briefing').item.json.filename }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0005-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Salvar no Obsidian (Automations)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.readWriteFile",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://10.42.0.1:8787/api/n8n/command",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "type",
              "value": "proactive_say"
            },
            {
              "name": "message",
              "value": "={{ $('Gerar Nota de Briefing').item.json.proactiveSay }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        }
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0006-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Notificar Usami (Fila de Comandos)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1300,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "wDuW9xOBtCooZtN2",
          "name": "Usami Token"
        },
        "genericAuth": {
          "id": "wDuW9xOBtCooZtN2",
          "name": "Usami Token"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://10.42.0.1:8787/api/n8n/command",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "content-type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "type",
              "value": "gesture"
            },
            {
              "name": "name",
              "value": "wave"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 3000
        }
      },
      "id": "e1f2a3b4-0007-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Notificar Usami (Gesto)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1520,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "wDuW9xOBtCooZtN2",
          "name": "Usami Token"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
